Hey TamisonEcoPrimal,

Thank you for signing up for a Premium membership with us! Your support i=
s what keeps our site and community going.

Subscription type: Annual premium with 3-day free trial
Next payment due: 17 November 2026 22:33 UTC=C2=B9
Subscription reference: sub_01m7e33p47pzcn15gw9c8fhhqy
Amount: $89.99=C2=B2

=C2=B9Please note this date and time is shown in UTC; this might be a dif=
ferent date or time in your location.
=C2=B2Price calculated with your current local tax rate. This could chang=
e if your local tax rate changes.

If you would like to make any changes to your subscription you can do so =
here: https://users.nexusmods.com/account/billing?utm_campaign=3Dsubscrip=
tion_started&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_source=3Dnexusmods

If you're having any problems with our service or have any questions, don=
't hesitate to talk to us. You can post on our forums (https://forums.nex=
usmods.com?utm_source=3Dnexusmods&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dsubsc=
ription_started), join our Discord (https://discord.gg/nexusmods) or emai=
l support@nexusmods.com and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.

Thank you again for supporting our community!

The Nexus Mods Team


